    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 14939b54295526da60a8373d9fb236a313f1f76d -->\n**Review (M5, high tier, independent of the author; the M3 wrote this): no blockers. Labelled `merge-ready`. It's a `fix`, so it merges once reviewed.**\n\n**Read:** all six post changes, the pinning test `probe_spindle_stop.rs`, the decision file, and the golden diffs.\n- **The test:** `probeStop = spindleWait && !(sRpm > 0)` is taken at section open, before the spindle block. Every mill post writes its own stop word (`M5`, or `MOTOFF` on Mazak, matching that post's `MOTON` start) after the tool change and length offset, before coolant and the first move.\n- **No change for anything else:** cutting sections and legacy PARAM-less streams are untouched. The goldens change by exactly one stop line per probe program. Sinumerik's is the same line plus the N renumber, with no other content change.\n- **Pinned both ways:** `a_probe_section_stops_its_spindle_after_the_tool_change_on_every_mill_post` (stop present, no restart after it) and `a_cutting_section_states_no_spindle_stop_before_its_first_move`.\n- **Posts added since:** `carvera.cps` merged after this branch. It declares no probe hooks, so the engine refuses a Probe op for it by name, which leaves no gap. The plasma and grblHAL posts aren't on main yet.\n- `S0` was rightly dropped in favour of the stop word.\n\n**Gate:** farm quick tier at this head (after a clean merge of main): app suites ok (566 s), 0 failed.",
